                                                                 rdfs:comment """This is an application profile for biocatalytic experiments based on the
STRENDA Biocatalysis Guidelines (https://github.com/Strenda-biocatalysis/Strenda-biocatalysis).""" ;
                                                                 rdfs:label "StrenDCAT-Biocatalysis" .

