<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_P310> rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ;
                                           <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A property used to indicate the standing of a concept in relation to currently accepted classifications and concepts. In NCI Thesaurus concept status subtype indicates concepts with unusual and problematic characteristics that should be evaluated by people and/or programs before those concept are used." ;
