###  https://w3id.org/mvoelken-hub/StrenDCAT-Biocatalysis/well_shape
strendcat_biocatalysis:well_shape rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                  rdfs:subPropertyOf strendcat_biocatalysis:has_qualitative_attribute ;
