###  https://w3id.org/mvoelken-hub/StrenDCAT-Biocatalysis/AmountOfSubstance
strendcat_biocatalysis:AmountOfSubstance rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                         rdfs:subClassOf strendcat_biocatalysis:QuantitativeAttribute ;
                                         rdfs:label "AmountOfSubstance" ;
