                                       skos:exactMatch <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001413> .


###  https://w3id.org/mvoelken-hub/StrenDCAT-Biocatalysis/Any
strendcat_biocatalysis:Any rdf:type owl:Class ;
                           rdfs:label "Any" ;
